# Canonical identities for git's own tools: shortlog, log and blame.
#
# One person committed under two addresses, which split the history into two
# contributors. The address on the left is the canonical one; every address on
# the right maps onto it.
#
# This file is read by git only. GitHub's contributor graph resolves authorship
# through the addresses linked to an account, so the same unification there
# needs enniolopes@gmail.com added under Settings -> Emails.

